# Quantitative Stochastic Homogenization and Large-Scale Regularity

Root of the Lean 4 formalization of Armstrong–Kuusi–Mourrat, *Quantitative Stochastic Homogenization
and Large-Scale Regularity*.

One module per section of the book, in the directories `Ch01` to `Ch11` for the chapters and `AppA`
to `AppE` for the appendices, with the front matter in `Front` and the statements frozen for the
formalization of the Einstein relation in `Frozen`. The namespace is `QSH`.
-/
